### Manual demo requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ HTTP client: click "Send Request")
### Start the app first: ./gradlew bootRun --args="--server.port=8081"
@base = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Stats before
GET {{base}}/campaigns/1/stats

### 2. user-99 already has 2 redemptions on campaign 1 (one voided) -> rejected by the limit
POST {{base}}/vouchers/RAYA-0001/redeem?userId=user-99

### 3. A new user: first redeem -> OK
POST {{base}}/vouchers/RAYA-0001/redeem?userId=user-5

### 4. Second redeem -> OK
POST {{base}}/vouchers/RAYA-0002/redeem?userId=user-5

### 5. Third redeem -> FAILED, per-user limit reached
POST {{base}}/vouchers/RAYA-0003/redeem?userId=user-5

### 6. Limit is per campaign: user-99 can still redeem on campaign 2
POST {{base}}/vouchers/MRDK-0001/redeem?userId=user-99

### 7. Stats after (RAYA-0003 is still ACTIVE: the rejected request consumed nothing)
GET {{base}}/campaigns/1/stats
